The derived files have been modified: they were adapted to PeakUI's components
and styles, rewritten where they depended on packages PeakUI does not use, and
all original branding, content, analytics and hosted assets were removed. The
derived portions include, among others, the documentation layout under
src/components/fumadocs, the component preview and code block components, the
MDX component map, the global stylesheet and the llms.txt generation code.
